@startuml
title Learner Takes and Submits a Quiz

actor Learner
boundary "Web UI" as UI
control "Quiz Controller" as QC
database "Database" as DB

ref over Learner,DB
  Authentication
end ref

== Access Published Module ==

Learner -> UI : Open published module
UI -> QC : Request module details
QC -> DB : Get published module
DB --> QC : Module data
QC --> UI : Module content
UI --> Learner : Display material

== Start Quiz ==

Learner -> UI : Start quiz
UI -> QC : Load quiz
QC -> DB : Retrieve quiz questions
DB --> QC : Questions
QC --> UI : Quiz content
UI --> Learner : Display quiz

== Submit Quiz ==

Learner -> UI : Submit answers
UI -> QC : Validate submission
QC -> DB : Check previous submission

alt Already submitted
    DB --> QC : Submission exists
    QC --> UI : Reject submission
    UI --> Learner : Quiz already submitted
else First submission
    DB --> QC : No submission found
    QC -> DB : Save answers
    QC -> DB : Create submission\n(Status = PENDING)
    DB --> QC : Saved
    QC --> UI : Submission successful
    UI --> Learner : Result pending review
end

== Follow Approval Status ==

Learner -> UI : View status
UI -> QC : Request status
QC -> DB : Retrieve status
DB --> QC : Pending / Approved / Revoked
QC --> UI : Status
UI --> Learner : Display status

@enduml
